<title>SWITZERLAND: SwissRe confirms Winterthur stake.</title>
<headline>SwissRe confirms Winterthur stake.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Reinsurance confirmed that it had a stake of around five percent in Winterthur Insurance, as investor Martin Ebner had asserted.</p>
<p>&quot;As a matter of policy Swiss Re does not comment on its share investments,&quot; it said in a brief statement.</p>
<p>&quot;However, in this case and in agreement with Winterthur, Swiss Re confirms that it owns about five percent of Winterthur shares outstanding.&quot;</p>
<p>It gave no more details.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
